 able to customise Synth partner (Alpha / Beta)\n- Levels based on the Audio books as well (believe they are cannon) \n- More apparel options\n\nRating: 9/10", "timestamp_created": 1642941611, "timestamp_updated": 1642941611, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "108603227", "author": {"steamid": "76561198090480895", "personaname": "ACOISPIKE", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198090480895/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1951, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 431, "last_played": 1758585323, "avatar": "a45df63d7163001364e6f6c895d6feeb240c6c6d"}, "language": "english", "review": "nice", "timestamp_created": 1642932071, "timestamp_updated": 1642932071, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47413790225982666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "108595638", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026245603", "personaname": "Ser Horn of Dog", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/epic202/", "num_games_owned": 140, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 100, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 100, "last_played": 1629862248, "avatar": "a8091fa7e1c73cf1289ef49f74e105e0c0f5562f"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is why you should never trust steam reviews. Absolute ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥.", "timestamp_created": 1642922667, "timestamp_updated": 1642922667, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.503759443759918213", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "108588472", "author": {"steamid": "76561197968689453", "personaname": "Anime Avatar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197968689453/", "num_games_owned": 90, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1048, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1048, "last_played": 1632972844, "avatar": "47ee598941779f2c4307debf37f725d6a3db22bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "UPDATE: Charging for DLC on a half-baked $60 game is insulting and you shouldn't pay for it. There are better uses of your cash. \n___\nLike a fat kid beginning puberty, this game had potential. Unfortunately it appears that it won't amount to much in the end. \nFor a while the game is fun and scratches the itches that any Alien game should. It is very short and delivers much less than a reasonable person could expect for the price point. The encounters with aliens offer no randomization which quickly removes the \"behind every shadow and around every corner\" suspense that the franchise did such an incredible job cultivating over the decades.\nIf you find it on sale for 20 bucks definitely get a couple buddies to buy it with and have a good time, until then save yourself the cash.\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1642912975, "timestamp_updated": 1683000353, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}]}